+/**
+ * Serial-keyed platform certificates, so `Wechatpay-Serial` selects the
+ * verifying key and rotation is a configuration change. Serials are derived
+ * from the certificates themselves, so no serial has to be transcribed by
+ * hand. Material that is not a parseable X.509 certificate — a public-key-only
+ * PEM, for example — is skipped, leaving the legacy single-certificate path in
+ * place rather than silently trusting nothing.
